silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_02_probe_tsn_identity_concrete_anchor_2#mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is The colimit apex of D_Mittens; target of iota_tsn but NOT equal to the TSN identifier. Mittens has ten typed legs; a database primary key has none of them. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
